<textcomponents>
<component id="ID_s1_title">
<text><![CDATA[<b>Sintaks Perintah IPv6</b>]]></text>
</component>

  <component id="ID_s1_table">
  <text><![CDATA[<table bordercolor="#98D3D1" borderwidth="3" cellpadding="4" class="mtable" glow="true" glowcolor="#808080" header="none" shadow="false" shadowcolor="#000000">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#0E6360" class="mtable_top" colspan="2"><font color="#0E6360" size="1"><span style="color:#98D3D1">.</span></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#077A77" class="mtitle" valign="top" width="110"><font color="#ffffff"><b>Parameter</b></font></td>
<td bgcolor="#077A77" class="mtitle" valign="top"><font color="#ffffff"><b>Keterangan</b></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#EFF8F7" valign="top"><font color="#393536" face="_typewriter">ipv6-prefix</font></td>
<td bgcolor="#EFF8F7" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><textformat blockindent="-16">Destination network address of the remote network to be added to the routing table.</textformat></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536" face="_typewriter">prefix-length</font></td>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536">Prefix length of the remote network to be added to the routing table.</font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#EFF8F7" valign="top"><font color="#393536" face="_typewriter">ipv6-address</font></td>
<td bgcolor="#EFF8F7" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><textformat blockindent="-16"><ul class="bulletIndent20"><li>Biasanya disebut sebagai alamat IP router hop berikutnya.</li><li>Biasanya digunakan saat menghubungkan ke media penyiaran (yaitu Ethernet).</li><li>Biasanya membuat pencarian rekursif.</li></ul></textformat></font></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536" face="_typewriter">exit-intf</font></td>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" valign="top"><font color="#393536"><textformat blockindent="-16"><ul class="bulletIndent20"><li>Gunakan antarmuka keluar untuk meneruskan paket ke jaringan tujuan.</li><li>Juga disebut sebagai rute statis yang terpasang langsung.</li>
<li>Biasanya digunakan saat menghubungkan dalam konfigurasi point-to-point.</li></ul></textformat></font></td></tr></table>]]></text>
  </component>


